 :turns (vec (repeatedly 3 #((:step! seam))))\n                :calls @calls :events (events r) :closes-before-close @closes))\n     ((:close! seam)))))\n(println :injected-contract-assertions @assertions :passed)\ngitdir: /home/sto/ci/datomworld-j6e-linux/.git/worktrees/dw-j7\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
